WHY THE SPLIT

The valuable part of this repository is the reasoning, and reasoning does not
stay put. Five people who had never read these documents re-invented parts of
them unprompted, and that is the point rather than a leak — a method that only
works where it is installed is not a method. So the method is free, and the
condition is credit.

The tools are a different question. They are the part someone could ship inside
a product, and that is the conversation worth having in advance.

